ighbour

A real cluster is emerging around dynamic capability discovery +
machine-readable price + autonomous payment + execution. Monid=E2=80=99s =
=E2=80=98one
capability plane=E2=80=99 is converging with x402 marketplaces. The securit=
y
scarcity moves from API integration to spend authority + seller
provenance + capability provenance + receipt verification.

Privately probe: build an Agent Commerce Firewall sitting before these
routers: max spend per call/task/day, seller allow/deny/reputation,
capability hash, quote diff, recipient pinning, simulation where
possible, signed receipt, human escalation.

mguard =E2=80=94 state firewall becoming a product category

mguard is a concrete nearest neighbour to the persistent-state
firewall thesis: memory writes are security-sensitive actions, not
ordinary RAG ingestion. The next useful Privately abstraction should
